PATH-FLOW ARCHITECTURE UNIVERSALITY EXPERIMENT V2
====================================================

Environment
-----------
N_train=60,000, N_val=10,000, N_test=10,000, d=32
N_train/d=1875.0
Teacher=32->[512, 256, 256, 128, 128, 112, 95, 64, 53, 32, 27, 16, 16, 8]->1; noise fraction=0.05

Architecture map
----------------
Unique realized architectures=1008
Dense stratified Sobol requested=600; diversity-constrained BO accepted=400
SMAC used=True
Initial structural clusters=3; silhouette=0.2187

Temporal design
---------------
Selected for training=48
Fixed longitudinal cohort=48
Funnel architectures=0
Exhaustive per-architecture mode=True
Geometry checkpoints=[0, 1, 2, 5, 8, 12, 16, 20, 30, 40, 50, 60, 80, 120, 160, 200, 250, 300, 350, 399]
Longitudinal BCANw scales=72
Common plotting x-range=[0.08, 20.0]

Temporal variance principle
---------------------------
ALL scale-by-epoch mean/SD/16-84% bands are computed only from the fixed longitudinal
cohort. Therefore temporal changes in variance are not caused by architectures being
pruned from the sample.

